## Model card

- **Name:** Omen Alpha
- **Short description:** OpenCode's high-throughput stealth coding and reasoning foundation model featured in the OpenCode Go subscription, offering 189 tokens/sec generation, 500K context, and visual input.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Go (`omen-alpha`), OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-04 release; knowledge cutoff mid-2026.
- **IDs:** `opencode/omen-alpha`. Available under the $10/mo OpenCode Go plan.
- **Context window:** 500,000 tokens total (500K context window); max output 128,000 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text, code, and tool-calling output; integrated reasoning traces.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09):** Included in OpenCode Go ($10/month subscription; estimated ~57,900 requests/month).
- **Architecture:** Unannounced proprietary mixture-of-experts architecture (backend paths suggest Zhipu AI / GLM lineage) optimized for extreme output speed (~189 tok/s).

